WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:06,715
Meet Snap — the studio platform for
photographers. Bookings, galleries, contracts,

2
00:00:06,715 --> 00:00:09,818
payments. One login, one bill, and zero
percent commission. Ever.

3
00:00:10,618 --> 00:00:13,910
It starts with one link. Your client picks a
session, picks a time,

4
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:16,121
pays the deposit. Booked — in under a minute.

5
00:00:16,921 --> 00:00:20,051
Every new inquiry lands in Leads — triage,
reply, and convert,

6
00:00:20,051 --> 00:00:21,465
right next to your bookings.

7
00:00:22,265 --> 00:00:26,221
Booked work moves down a pipeline built for
shoots. Every job carries its files,

8
00:00:26,221 --> 00:00:27,853
gallery, invoices, and contracts.

9
00:00:28,653 --> 00:00:29,717
When the shoot wraps,

10
00:00:29,717 --> 00:00:33,719
choose from ten designer templates and preview
each one with your photos. Live.

11
00:00:34,519 --> 00:00:37,454
Clients open a verified link, protected by a
six-digit code.

12
00:00:37,454 --> 00:00:40,535
They favorite their picks, share the gallery,
and order prints.

13
00:00:41,335 --> 00:00:44,850
And payments go straight to your own Stripe.
Snap never holds your money,

14
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,787
and never takes a cut. That fee goes to Stripe
— never to us.

15
00:00:48,587 --> 00:00:52,437
Snap. Your studio, in focus. Start free —
twenty gigabytes, no credit card.
